---
const steps = [
  { title: "Log in the normal way", body: "Connect Bolt, Uber, Upwork or GitHub. We never see your password." },
  { title: "Pick what to prove", body: "\"Active since 2023\", \"over 5,000 trips\". Everything else stays private." },
  { title: "Send a link", body: "Employers see the claims, where they came from, and a check that they are genuine." },
];
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Proofed — your work history, verified</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Turn your platform work history into a private, verifiable credential employers anywhere can trust." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <h1>I'm proofed.</h1>
      <p>Your work history, verified and private. Prove what you've done on the platforms employers already know, and reveal nothing else.</p>
    </header>
    <section aria-labelledby="how">
      <h2 id="how">How it works</h2>
      <ol>
        {steps.map((s) => (
          <li>
            <h3>{s.title}</h3>
            <p>{s.body}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="who">
      <h2 id="who">Who it's for</h2>
      <p>People whose experience is hard to check across borders, and the employers, recruiters and NGOs who want to hire them.</p>
    </section>
  </body>
  <style>
    :root { --crust: #8a4b1f; --dough: #f6e7cf; --flour: #fffaf2; --ink: #2a1d12; }
    body { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 44rem; padding: 2rem 1rem; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--flour); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.5; }
    h1 { color: var(--crust); font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    ol { padding-left: 1.25rem; }
  </style>
</html>
